{"id":"a3c41e3442057746","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-hypersimple-set.md","title":"Hypersimple Set","display":"df-hypersimple-set — Hypersimple Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-hypersimple-set","aliases":["90-df-hypersimple-set"],"display":"df-hypersimple-set — Hypersimple Set","depends_on":["[[90-df-simple-set]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-hypersimple-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-hypersimple-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hypersimple-set — Hypersimple Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30f3283b9dedba60\" href=\"?note=30f3283b9dedba60\" title=\"90-df-simple-set\">90-df-simple-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline H\">\\(\\overline H\\)</span> 在下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，以下以关系图定义主函数，不要求有限集合也有全枚举。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSimple}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSimple}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\overline H&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\setminus H,\\\\\np_A&amp;:=\\{(n,a)\\in\\mathbb N^2:a\\in A\\land|A\\cap\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;a\\}|=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists n,a\\in\\mathbb N\\\n[n\\ge N\\land(n,a)\\in p_{\\overline H}\\land a&gt;f(n)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\overline H&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\setminus H,\\\\\np_A&amp;:=\\{(n,a)\\in\\mathbb N^2:a\\in A\\land|A\\cap\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;a\\}|=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists n,a\\in\\mathbb N\\\n[n\\ge N\\land(n,a)\\in p_{\\overline H}\\land a&gt;f(n)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限初段计数严格递增于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的相继元素，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_A\">\\(p_A\\)</span> 单值；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 无限时它恰为从零开始的递增全枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline H\">\\(\\overline H\\)</span> 无限，因此断言与原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\forall N\\exists n\\ge N\\ p_{\\overline H}(n)&gt;f(n)\">\\(\\forall f\\forall N\\exists n\\ge N\\ p_{\\overline H}(n)&gt;f(n)\\)</span> 完全一致。没有把这个良定义的非支配性条件换成另一版本的 hypersimplicity 定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-simple-set","status":"resolved","id":"30f3283b9dedba60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-simple-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-simple-set","status":"resolved","id":"30f3283b9dedba60","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[90-df-simple-set]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。$\\overline H$ 在下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Simple}$ 见 [[90-df-simple-set]]，$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。$\\overline H$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline H","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HSimple}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\overline H&\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\setminus H,\\\\\np_A&:=\\{(n,a)\\in\\mathbb N^2:a\\in A\\land|A\\cap\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<a\\}|=n\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{HSimple}(H)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{Simple}(H)\\land\n\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\forall N\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists n,a\\in\\mathbb N\\\n[n\\ge N\\land(n,a)\\in p_{\\overline H}\\land a>f(n)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Simple}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline H","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\forall N\\exists n\\ge N\\ p_{\\overline H}(n)>f(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1561,"backlinks":[{"id":"279ca56a651294c7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{HSimple}$、$\\mathrm{Simple}$、$\\mathrm{Creative}$ 见 [[90-df-hypersimple-set]]、[[90-df-simple-set]]、[[90-df-creative-set]]。"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-simple-set]]、[[90-prop-simple-immune]]、[[90-df-hypersimple-set]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df